{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0363_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0363_story_03_synopsis", "source_sha256": "33df412a87e40aaeef686cee17ab44737f07344172a21eadff07ba08d2b7a389", "ja": "配置転換で地球に降りた『ガーデン』は、\nテンタクルスの大規模降下作戦の迎撃命令を\n受ける。規模が1万以上と聞き動揺する中、\nミキは頑なに応戦の考えを変えない。説得を\n諦めたシホはエミリーに何事か指示を出す。", "zh": "因调动而降落地球的『花园』，接到了拦截触手族大规模降落作战的命令。听说规模达到1万以上，大家都陷入动摇之中，但美希仍固执地不肯改变应战的想法。志保放弃劝说，转而向艾米莉下达了某项指示。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0363_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0363_story_03_1000_null", "source_sha256": "3d422fe124600187484d235c96c49e167a67ccd2a7856f5a259befef5e064700", "ja": "Archival record 004\n-Unidentified time-　かつてのある日(2)", "zh": "Archival record 004\n-Unidentified time-　过去的某一天(2)", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0363_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0363_story_03_1001_003mik", "source_sha256": "afe64a83ddfe757fbb5e30fcc1f94ce6ccc6c635b0d90d3d7fb8f3082f712f2d", "ja": "つっ……。", "zh": "嘶……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0363_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0363_story_03_1002_027say", "source_sha256": "6a458914073fe04114b1707b404b599ccb30e267023df12198a61e013391ade8", "ja": "ミキ……。また頭痛？\n大丈夫？　明日地球に降りるのに……。", "zh": "美希……又头疼了？  \n没事吧？明天还要降落到地球……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0363_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0363_story_03_1003_003mik", "source_sha256": "f93f89403ee535c301722b2dc9e965bc75b9ff251faa11cee3fa02f4eb56eaf5", "ja": "平気、すぐ治まるし。\nいつものことだから。", "zh": "没事，很快就会好的。\n反正都是老毛病了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0363_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0363_story_03_1004_027say", "source_sha256": "ba8a7fe2edfaa8023813e35688458ade012f600cf1c81b4edd3eb668a33aa840", "ja": "そう。ならいいけど……。\nあんまり、急ぎ過ぎないでね。", "zh": "这样啊，那就好……不过，别太着急了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0363_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0363_story_03_1005_003mik", "source_sha256": "fe2640d606e4cab4e39f56117aab65a677dc5225cc9101a8fe5505014012200a", "ja": "？　なにが？", "zh": "嗯？什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0363_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0363_story_03_1006_027say", "source_sha256": "84e3a554689274080dd844ba63e2e1d0852a746c825b93ff4aca1291bb0989a0", "ja": "全部。飛び方も、戦い方も。……生き方も。", "zh": "全部。飞行的方式、战斗的方式……还有生存的方式。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0363_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0363_story_03_1007_003mik", "source_sha256": "649b354a753a5e3560fdd1513fbe3074cda82f18b6734613a53746b4aa2882f3", "ja": "……。うん、気を付ける。\n別に、焦ってるわけじゃないよ？", "zh": "……。嗯，美希会小心的。\n倒也没有在着急啦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0363_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0363_story_03_1008_027say", "source_sha256": "6399983d564bd6a7acf859f066cfc1104e0e29b1286c6e6ce317fb87f7a3d80d", "ja": "わかってるけど……見てると、たまにね。\n不安になるから。", "zh": "我知道，不过……有时候看着你，\n还是会觉得有些不安。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0363_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0363_story_03_1009_027say", "source_sha256": "fd3b50db4226414d5b1dc64e6ffdb13f54dbf2abd5987f8afc7ec14a7484c8e0", "ja": "ふふっ、あんなにのんびり屋さんだったのにね！\n隊長が今のミキを見たら、びっくりするんだろうな。", "zh": "呵呵，明明以前还是那么悠哉的孩子呢！\n队长要是看到现在的美希，肯定会大吃一惊吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0363_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0363_story_03_1011_027say", "source_sha256": "0c2a99c67521f0f6b38254cad3b44992a881aec3be1a7d1875ccf66b896b9c7b", "ja": "あ。……ごめん、つい……。", "zh": "啊……抱歉，不由得就……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0363_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0363_story_03_1012_003mik", "source_sha256": "03d0edfd722433a6a63824aae08102f1b04466ab5dd5fe578301adda91bd4cfb", "ja": "ううん。……ミキの方こそ、心配かけてごめんなさい。\nサヨコは、ハニーの代わりをしてくれてるのに。", "zh": "不……该道歉的是美希，害你担心了。\n明明沙代子还在替亲爱的帮忙……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0363_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0363_story_03_1013_027say", "source_sha256": "a758bc903bd0f6bf851f1b0e1caa68514492cb929ccf2a357150351862a49869", "ja": "あの人の代わりなんて、できないよ。\n……ガーデンの隊長役だけで、精いっぱい。", "zh": "我没法代替那个人。  \n……光是担任花园的队长，就已经让我竭尽全力了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0363_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0363_story_03_1014_003mik", "source_sha256": "6734a37cef69521e6d20fa74eb8952b82ef04f3c75d1c81637da7f58dcce3eb5", "ja": "助かってる。ありがと。", "zh": "帮大忙了。谢谢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0363_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0363_story_03_1015_003mik", "source_sha256": "d7edb9c53af5fffb3d5602b586838342e1df7cceb1cc33d5e83adf0cdb916f3f", "ja": "……あのね。ミキ、約束したの。\n絶対に、止まらないって。", "zh": "……我说啊。美希和人做过约定的。\n绝对，不会停下脚步。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0363_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0363_story_03_1016_003mik", "source_sha256": "2efcaf7289490fb5f1f4614f969038b4cfcd4902ea437bdab9c0b4d9e72d484a", "ja": "止まったら、終わらないから。\n……終わらせたいから。", "zh": "停下来的话，就永远无法结束了。\n……因为美希想要做个了结。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0363_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0363_story_03_1017_027say", "source_sha256": "d26d8f5a4f9f0d33a908d3b6b2c7d302585f3d883268a9e6aa9d1179a16390a9", "ja": "……うん、終わらせよう。\nいつか絶対。だから、それまで……ね？", "zh": "……嗯，去结束它吧。\n总有一天一定会。所以在那之前……好吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0363_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0363_story_03_1018_003mik", "source_sha256": "24cda1ce1fd27198403d89324c7c77d3353fce3537c4932b65ba2366d5dd1c9a", "ja": "……大丈夫！　ミキ、わりと強いから。\nあはっ、おやすみ～。", "zh": "……没关系！美希其实挺坚强的。\n啊哈，晚安～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0363_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0363_story_03_1019_027say", "source_sha256": "c4d383e590bd235339566e7c76781741595f5b6a33e0d3126b8e03a7b49a4a34", "ja": "ふふっ、知ってる。\nおやすみなさい。", "zh": "呵呵，我知道。\n晚安。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0363_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0363_story_03_1020_027say", "source_sha256": "7dc99d91299ea1863c2c253c6ef5fea5580e32663cec369928b24a3f9fe78897", "ja": "…………。\nうそつき。", "zh": "…………。\n骗子。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0363_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0363_story_03_1021_null", "source_sha256": "7e4a7775b6d69aac8da8aa37b79929a19592f07713ff0188ca4850d91df735f2", "ja": "-At the moment-　現在", "zh": "-At the moment-　此刻", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0363_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0363_story_03_1022_null", "source_sha256": "8792fb471648d941acb8883c9e4ed93c0d6624ae814d38975552fc1c453bbd28", "ja": "地球　ウェスタンアメリカ戦区\n『ガーデン』駐留基地", "zh": "地球　美洲西部战区\n“花园”驻留基地", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0363_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0363_story_03_1023_030iku", "source_sha256": "8f4eab0e9d789cbb7f772c09f0ecf381f77216d49ab2a4d8c16a9c7510828da1", "ja": "テンタクルスの、降下作戦……？", "zh": "是触手们的空降作战……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0363_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0363_story_03_1024_032emi", "source_sha256": "cf2bdcdb4ff0ba96e1479a0f1ba5083049836701ee9a45923998f8fec51229a4", "ja": "軌道上から海岸地区に向かって一斉に降りて来るの。\nそれで私たちに迎撃命令が出たんだけど……。", "zh": "触手兽的空降作战……？\n它们会从轨道上朝海岸地区成批降落。于是我们接到了迎击命令，可是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0363_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0363_story_03_1025_032emi", "source_sha256": "50e6eaa0f6a9ff13fc276f7a0751f09b0583d7f3d2e97f7602ed1fc8c9264197", "ja": "有人機はともかく、機兵の数がね。\n1万以上が協働してるんだって。", "zh": "有人机还好说，但机兵的数量嘛。\n据说1万以上在协同作战呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0363_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0363_story_03_1026_030iku", "source_sha256": "186728db99b76f3b61dd3adf3b8eb2257daaa76f1275fd1d03c67c4a6149b234", "ja": "1万……！　そんなにたくさんいるの？\nそれって、大変なんじゃ……。", "zh": "1万……！有那么多吗？\n那不是很辛苦吗……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0363_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0363_story_03_1027_033sih", "source_sha256": "7c17026eccf22abe56978effb9493ad0cddff8824620be76df0580194865aca8", "ja": "無茶ですよ！　全然足りない。\nユニオンは……中央はこれだから！", "zh": "太乱来了！完全不够。\n联合……中央就是这样！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0363_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0363_story_03_1028_027say", "source_sha256": "59ec97491e33c35ed9fa577f9f2d6e83ec87024225afb94a04e8a9f2b47bd38b", "ja": "とにかく時間を稼ぐしかない。\n距離を取りながら引き付けて。……でも……。", "zh": "总之只能设法争取时间了。\n一边拉开距离，一边把它引过来。……但是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0363_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0363_story_03_1029_033sih", "source_sha256": "69b90329310c15a3c93cdd742e2d623130f0f0e5bc73e9eb0985f83978f63312", "ja": "相手にされないでしょうね。火力が足りない。\nせめて友軍と合流してからの方が……。", "zh": "你不会把我当回事吧。火力不够。\n至少也要和友军会合之后再……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0363_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0363_story_03_1030_003mik", "source_sha256": "7d980304a5e9d6fe0ac6880f2347d56d55a6786ee5b79f2c98334d6f71e59cfc", "ja": "平気だよ。ミキが真ん中に行くから。\nそしたら集まって、追っかけて来るでしょ？", "zh": "没事的。美希去正中间。\n这样一来，他们就会聚集起来追过来了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0363_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0363_story_03_1031_033sih", "source_sha256": "23b7d749b080d1d86fa65d5dd7495436211c600d7e543b63f6ebe89e50d9ac91", "ja": "先輩……。\nいい加減にしてください。", "zh": "前辈……  \n请适可而止吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0363_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0363_story_03_1032_033sih", "source_sha256": "48d62140175942e07e85866d0ff290d1c599ce4fd1439e5408e274b6a93a3059", "ja": "それじゃ1万全部に囲まれるじゃないですか。\n死にたいんですか！", "zh": "那样不就会被整整1万包围了吗。你是想死吗！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0363_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0363_story_03_1033_003mik", "source_sha256": "5ba15f156b94e0eb6305d65e3fea93e557341c88d95335251395a0c223759066", "ja": "ミキ、死なないよ？", "zh": "美希不会死的哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0363_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0363_story_03_1034_033sih", "source_sha256": "d720a01dd1b18272a72db7f92195ac504ef38e61b3d47cdfcbb8260026cc7d39", "ja": "そうじゃなくて！", "zh": "不是这个意思！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0363_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0363_story_03_1035_030iku", "source_sha256": "541fbf452e63f9f82e75eee76c53f6911587f4bd34a1000f78439cc902484511", "ja": "でも、止めなかったら……。\nみんなを、守れない……！", "zh": "可是，要是不阻止的话……\n就保护不了大家了……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0363_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0363_story_03_1036_003mik", "source_sha256": "198be03fcce4ccb1afe7e2ebbc878ca544ef8c8f1a5ea784079b94728dcb1aac", "ja": "じゃあ止めるしかないの。大丈夫、ミキ負けないから。\n全部、見えるから。", "zh": "那就只能阻止了。没关系，美希不会输的。\n因为一切都看得见。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0363_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0363_story_03_1037_033sih", "source_sha256": "4e1db64abe6a91cb73b226604dc3a1b924d1f2aa22d2fc5d3b4072359d91567a", "ja": "だから！　見えても、できないことが……。\nあなたにも……誰にでもあるじゃないですか！", "zh": "所以才说！即使看得见，也有做不到的事……你也是……谁都有做不到的事，不是吗！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0363_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0363_story_03_1038_033sih", "source_sha256": "9effb4c6b076e9541cc810d957df11dd75a9c59301c67d98be6989f9c20de184", "ja": "わかって……くれませんか……？", "zh": "您就……不能理解吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0363_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0363_story_03_1039_003mik", "source_sha256": "cec72715d9bdcdb570cb853ef292ed380c14aeac553ed4cec30800161e9a71a0", "ja": "シホ……？", "zh": "志保……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0363_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0363_story_03_1040_003mik", "source_sha256": "2382a43f8e4b4c828c3b92a84c62898758d2a9d8285b2be40f2665f1a25544ad", "ja": "ごめんね。できるかどうかじゃなくて……。\nううん。シホはみんなのこと、お願い。", "zh": "对不起。不是能不能做到的问题……\n嗯。志保，大家就拜托你了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
